Subject: [PATCH] test(telemetry): live-verify accelerator CPU/RAM tick and fix
 dashboards collector

collect_dashboards_live called _parse_cpu_cores without importing it, so the
dashboards payload crashed before Acceleration or environment.accelerators
could be served. Import the helper and cover the environment tick, live
collectors, and CPU/RAM dashboard wiring.
